        "I am Mark Luna, Commercial Director, and together with my team, we create experiences across Peru and Bolivia, caring for the details that so often make the difference between a good trip and an unforgettable one.",
        "We are grateful for the trust you place in us and for the opportunity to accompany you as you discover our destinations.",
      ],
      name: "Mark Luna",
      role: "Commercial Director",
      imageAlt: "Mark Luna, Commercial Director of Dreamy Tours",
    },
    eyebrow: "Travel professionals",
    title: "A team behind every journey",
    paragraphs: [
      "A great travel experience starts with a great team.",
      "At Dreamy Tours, our specialists work across traveler care, reservations, operations and tourism service coordination.",
      "We work as one team to keep every itinerary detail organized and provide support whenever our travelers need it.",
    ],
